	(text "Use a paralel resistance to charge and discharge capacitors safely\n!!\nObserve transient with an oscilloscope\nand set R and C to get a proper time constant.\nMAY BE EEUFS0J472B and a Bleeder Resistor\n!!\n\nIf we use TPS630702RNMR then we will not need that resistor as it has\nQuick Output Discharge (QOD) ability"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
